cff-version: 1.2.0
title: scienceheartbeat
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "scienceheartbeat contributors"
url: "https://github.com/joernmht/scienceheartbeat"
repository-code: "https://github.com/joernmht/scienceheartbeat"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-06-19"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic heartbeat dashboard that turns the change history of git
  repositories into a living graph: repository and branch nodes pulse in
  colours keyed to the kind of change, with a scrub-able timeline. The pipeline
  emits a frozen, content-hashed JSON document that is byte-for-byte
  reproducible, consumed by a dependency-free web dashboard.
keywords:
  - git
  - visualization
  - dashboard
  - graph
  - determinism
  - observability
